Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Coffre nouveau: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault chiffrer: message clé: key.
>> decrypted := vault déchiffrer: encrypted clé: key.

Sortie 
écrire: ['Message:'], stop
écrire: message, stop
écrire: ['Decrypted:'], stop
écrire: decrypted, stop.
